# FaSelectInput and select modes

## Reuse the shared element

Multi-mode select / chips field → **`FaSelectInput`** from **`src/components/elements/FaSelectInput/`** with required **`mode`**, **`v-model`**, **`options`**, **`test-locator`**. **No** duplicate chip + filter + 600px menu + separatorAlt **`q-select`** wrappers in feature folders when this contract fits.

Playbook: [fantasia-select-input skill](../skills/fantasia-select-input/SKILL.md).

**Not** a drop-in for App Settings simple enum **`q-select`** (**`DialogAppSettingsSettingBlock`**) unless product wants chips / create-new / highlight UX.

## Stored value contract

| Mode | Options | Model (single / multi) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **`simple`** | strings | **`string`** / **`string[]`** |
| **`document`**, **`otherType`**, **`tags`** | **`I_faSelectInputObjectItem`** (`id`, `name`; optional `icon`, `documentType`, `otherType`, `isNew`) | item \| **`null`** / item[] |
| **`media`** | stub — always normalize to **`[]`** | typed only; do not ship UI on this mode yet |

Types + chip color consts: **`types/I_faSelectInput.ts`** (**`FA_SELECT_INPUT_*`**).

Create-new object items set **`isNew: true`** (teal chip). Parent calls expose **`clearIsNewFlags(ids)`** after persist succeeds.

## Mode / options pipeline

| Piece | Role |
| --- | --- |
| **`normalizeFaSelectInputOptions`** | Mode-filter option list; media → empty |
| **`filterFaSelectInputOptionsByQuery`** | Default filter (string / name / id substring) |
| **`splitFaSelectInputLabelForFilterHighlight`** | Whole-word match spans for option label |
| **`createFaSelectInputNewItem`** | Create-new payload (media → null) |
| **`appendFaSelectInputCreatedValue`** / **`createFaSelectInputChangePayload`** | Model append + **`change`** action |
| **`shouldShowFaSelectInputSelectedChip`** | Hide empty single selection chip |
| **`clearFaSelectInputIsNewFlags`** | Strip **`isNew`** by id |

Domain barrel: **`src/scripts/faSelectInput/faSelectInput_manager.ts`**.

## Layout constants (SCSS)

Menu width **600px** — **`$faSelectInput-menu-width`** / **`minWidth`** / **`maxWidth`** in **`styles/_variables.scss`** (forwarded via **`src/css/quasar.variables.scss`**). Keep in sync with **`FaSelectInput.unscoped.scss`**.

Hardcoded on SFC: **`menu-anchor="bottom middle"`**, **`menu-self="top middle"`**, **`popup-content-class="faSelectInput__menu"`**, **`use-chips`**, **`use-input`**, **`input-debounce="0"`**.

## Menu / option styling

- Active row: side bars only (no Quasar active wash) — unscoped menu sheet
- Between options: **`q-separator.faSelectInput__separatorAlt`** + **`fa-context-menu-separator-alt`** mixin ([fa-context-menu-dividers.mdc](fa-context-menu-dividers.mdc))
- Filter matches: **`faSelectInput__optionMatch`** (primary-bright, weight **500**)

## i18n and Storybook

- **No** element **`L_FaSelectInput`** tree today — parent supplies **`label`**; smoke labels may be hardcoded
- Storybook: **`_tests/FaSelectInput.stories.ts`** — **`Components/elements/FaSelectInput`**

## Two-level architecture

- **`src/scripts/faSelectInput/functions/`** — level-1 pure helpers only
- **`FaSelectInput/scripts/functions/createUseFaSelectInput.ts`** — level-1 composable factory
- **`faSelectInput_manager.ts`** (element) — wiring-only **`useFaSelectInput`**

